      <div type="entry">
        <sp who="#ml">
          <speaker>Lewis</speaker>
          <p>I observed several species of plants along the bank. The specimens appeared to be considerable.</p>
          <p>Took equal altitudes and recorded latitude with the octant before the party stirred.</p>
        </sp>
